---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Website Privacy Policy | TrueBridge";
const description =
  "A plain-language look at how the TrueBridge website handles information when you visit or reach out.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} {description}>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-canvas py-14 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="wpp-hero-heading">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 text-left sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <h1
          id="wpp-hero-heading"
          class="mb-6 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
        >
          Website privacy
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-[760px] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">
          A short, plain-language note about how this website works when you browse or reach out. This is separate from
          our
          <a
            href="/notice-of-privacy-practices"
            class="font-medium text-sageDark underline decoration-sand underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-clay hover:decoration-clay"
            >Notice of Privacy Practices</a
          >, which covers health information once you are a client.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-paper py-14 lg:py-20" aria-label="Website privacy details">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <p class="mb-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">Last updated: July 29, 2026</p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          When you contact us
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          If you email, call, or use a contact or scheduling form on this site, you may share your name, how to reach
          you, and a bit about why you are getting in touch. We use that information to respond and help you take the
          next step.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          For your comfort and privacy, please keep general messages brief. You do not need to share detailed clinical
          history, diagnoses, or trauma details in a first email or voicemail. If something feels urgent or unsafe, call
          or text 988, call 911, or go to the nearest emergency room.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Basic site visit information
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Like most websites, ours may collect simple technical information when pages load, such as browser type,
          device type, or which pages were viewed. We use this kind of information to keep the site working well and to
          understand what content is helpful, not to build a detailed personal profile of you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Tools that help the site run
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          We may use trusted services for things like website hosting, a contact form, scheduling, or basic analytics.
          Those tools only see what they need to do their job. If you submit information through a form or scheduling
          tool, that service helps deliver your request to us.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Health information and this website
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website is here to help you learn about TrueBridge and get in touch. It is not a patient portal. Once you
          begin care, how health information is handled is described in our
          <a
            href="/notice-of-privacy-practices"
            class="font-medium text-sageDark underline decoration-sand underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-clay hover:decoration-clay"
            >Notice of Privacy Practices</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Cookies
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          The site may use cookies or similar tools so pages load properly and so we can see general site usage. You can
          limit cookies in your browser settings if you prefer. Some features may work less smoothly if cookies are
          blocked.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Links to other sites
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Occasionally we may link to another website. Those sites have their own practices, and we are not responsible
          for their content or privacy settings.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Keeping information safe
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          We take reasonable steps to protect information connected with this website. No website or email system is
          perfectly secure, so please use your judgment about what you share in ordinary messages.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Who this site is for
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website is meant for adults looking into therapy for themselves or a partner. It is not designed for
          children to create accounts or submit personal information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Updates
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          We may update this page from time to time. The current version will always be posted here.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Questions
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          If you have questions about this page, you are welcome to
          <a
            href="/contact-get-started"
            class="font-medium text-sageDark underline decoration-sand underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-clay hover:decoration-clay"
            >contact us</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
